      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>Zanzibar's most famous dhow excursion: cruise to the Menai Bay Conservation Area, snorkel over vibrant coral reefs, feast on a seafood barbecue on a private sandbank, and visit Kwale Island. We book you onto the licensed original Safari Blue excursion.</p>
