      <li>Seafood barbecue lunch (grilled fish, prawns, calamari) on a sandbank</li>
      <li>Fresh fruit, water, and soft drinks throughout</li>
      <li>Menai Bay conservation fee included in package price</li>
      <li>Visit to Kwale Island for swimming</li>
